			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3647988">
									

<p>I couldn't get invested in this, primarily because I felt the whole things was rather shallow, We're only offered the vaguest glimpse of this person and what happened between them and their partner, and his motivations don't come off as poignant as they could. It feels far too direct, to the point of being almost cloying in the first and third collapsibles.</p>
<p>I think diving deeper into this, giving us more of their story, show how he grows and adapts over time, <em>show</em> his attitude and feelings (instead of blatantly &quot;telling&quot; throughout the logs) could give this more weight than it currently has.</p>
<p>As it stands, I can't feel anything for the character. I could see myself upvoting a strong character piece in this vein, but this is't it.</p>

